tools; nothing generated is tracked, and the translation claims nothing over the
original work's behaviour or ownership. The game's executable, data, artwork,
audio, music, maps and movies are still required from the player's own copy and
are never included.

Ghidra, Capstone, pefile, Unicorn, NumPy, Pillow and innoextract are external
development tools with their own licenses, not original game dependencies at
runtime. The kit's NOTICE lists the components it links (Lua, TinySoundFont,
SDL3, volk, the Vulkan headers) and their licenses.

The installer this port was measured from also contains third-party Windows
components that are not part of the port and are excluded from every bundle:
Firelight Technologies' FMOD 3.20a sound library (fmod.dll), the game's MIDI
helper (Soundlib.dll), a DirectDraw compatibility wrapper (SoADDraw.dll), the
two Dfx libraries, the GOG Galaxy client library and its wrapper (Galaxy.dll,
CGalaxy.dll), and GOG's installer support files under __redist/. They retain
their own ownership and licenses.
